# A `load` while a lava death is underway must cancel it like a savestate load does. By then the death's respawn
# preload is issued; the load force-ends it, and the game's ScenePreloader.Cleanup unloads it by an Addressables key
# SceneManager can't resolve, so it stayed loaded as a duplicate room. The death itself ran on through the load and the
# hero stayed on the death's non-colliding layer 2, falling through the floor into the lava again.
load Bone_East_12 104.93 7.57
SetHp, 1
   1

  34,R
  25

load Bone_East_12 104.93 8
 100
Assert, Equal, "scenes=1 dead=False layer=9", "scenes={SceneManager.sceneCount} dead={HeroController.cState.dead} layer={HeroController.gameObject.layer}"
***
